{
  "id": "pokemon-card-game-players-club-exp",
  "name": "Pokémon Card Game Players Club EXP",
  "category": "program",
  "description": {
    "text": "The EXP cards of the Pokémon Card Game Players Club, which members earned with EXP points from official events and weekly leagues. Plusle came at 2,000 EXP, Minun at 3,000, Celebi ex at 5,000 and Mew ex at 7,000; in the first two seasons, 2003 and 2004, each was mailed in its own cellophane packet.\n\nIn the third and fourth seasons, 2005 and 2006, members rose a level at each step of EXP. Those four cards became the prizes for levels 2 to 5, and five gold star Eeveelutions, 022 to 026/PLAY, the prizes for levels 6 to 10: Vaporeon at 10,000 EXP, Jolteon at 20,000, Flareon at 30,000, Espeon at 40,000 and Umbreon at 70,000. Espeon and Umbreon are especially rare, because their EXP was so hard to reach.",
